    "summary": "Belisarius Cawl gains MOBILE and moves 8″. When your Command phase begins, choose one Canticle for Cawl. It lasts until your following Command phase begins. For Machine Vengeance, mark one enemy unit at the same trigger and for the same duration. Friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS models can reroll hits against it. Mantra of Discipline makes Cawl BATTLELINE. Its Binharic Courage aura gives nearby friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS models +1 Objective Control and their unit +1 on Battle-shock or Leadership tests. Shroudpsalm gives nearby friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS units Stealth. Both auras reach 6″ from Cawl. The solar atomiser has 3 attacks at D6 damage.",
